<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 8.04 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 8.04 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 8.04 percent on Monday from 6.61 percent on Sunday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said seven banks traded on the market in 22 reported transactions with a total value of 21.2 million dinars ($30 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
